            "text": "theorem MeanClass.bilinear {s : StripData D} {α β : ℝ}\n    {f : ℕ → D → E} {g : ℕ → D → F}\n    (hf : MeanClass s α f) (hg : MeanClass s β g)\n    (hζ : ∀ x ∈ s.domain, s.zeta x ≤ 1) (L : E →L[ℝ] F →L[ℝ] G) :\n    MeanClass s (α + β) (fun n x => L (f n x) (g n x))"
